title: Example Pop-out Icon
tags: 
popout-icon: "2"
popout-icon-size: "small"
popout-icon-position: "top-right"
popout-icon-animation: "pulse"
popout-icon-tooltip: "2 new notifications"
popout-icon-color: "#7db3ff"

This tiddler demonstrates a pop-out icon with the text "2" in the top-right corner.

The icon has a pulse animation and appears as a glass-fog styled badge.

You can customize:
* Text (e.g., "!", "NEW", "★", "2")
* Size (small, medium, large)
* Position (top-right, top-left, bottom-right, bottom-left)
* Animation (pulse, bounce, rotate, none)
* Color (any CSS color)
* Tooltip text
* Click actions (navigate, popup, message)


